    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk how to even begin explaining this. everything i worked for is just... gone. everyone i thought was my friend, my whole circle, they all just turned around and left. it feels like i dont even exist to them anymore. like i'm just a ghost walking around. it's actually kind of funny how fast you can just become nothing to everyone.",
